    "created_at": "2026-09-21T07:11:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-21T07:11:16Z",
    "body": "Specifying a dialect of XML is also a big project, although I realize `<script>` and `<template>` bring us some of the way there.\n\nAlso browsers are still doing work on XML. E.g., it seems that Chromium is attempting to replace theirs with a Rust-based library.\n\ncc @drott ",
