    "updated_at": "2026-09-21T11:06:26Z",
    "body": "I agree with @annevk , maybe even we should be stricter with the XML encoding sniffing for HTML, now that HTML supports PIs. Checking the character after \"`<?xml`\", at least, seems reasonable to me.",
